  "ARC identifies Tommy Atkins and Kent among more heat/sunburn-tolerant options; Sensation and Keitt are more susceptible. Confirm local harvest dates before choosing a succession.": "ARC identifiseer Tommy Atkins en Kent onder die meer hitte-/sonbrandbestande opsies; Sensation en Keitt is meer vatbaar. Bevestig plaaslike oesdatums voordat jy 'n opeenvolging kies.",
