  "Afri-Star is an ARC-bred low-chill candidate with a stated 300–500 Infruitec Chilling Unit requirement; its December–January dates were obtained at Bien Donne, Simondium, Western Cape and need local checking elsewhere. Granny Smith has an Elgin first-pick reference in late March; SAPO names Golden Delicious or Hillieri as pollen partners. These are separate cultivar references, not a continuous picking season or a warm KZN recommendation. Confirm current nursery stock and local performance.": "Afri-Star is 'n ARC-geteelde lae-koue-kandidaat met 'n gestelde behoefte van 300–500 Infruitec-koue-eenhede; sy Desember–Januarie-datums is by Bien Donne, Simondium, Wes-Kaap verkry en moet elders plaaslik gekontroleer word. Granny Smith het 'n Elgin-verwysing vir eerste pluk laat in Maart; SAPO noem Golden Delicious of Hillieri as stuifmeelvennote. Dit is aparte kultivarverwysings, nie 'n aaneenlopende plukseisoen of 'n aanbeveling vir warm KZN nie. Bevestig huidige kwekeryvoorraad en plaaslike prestasie.",
