  "Available product illustrations, in one style. The plan also includes researched plants without a product illustration. Suitability and production depend on your farm’s climate, plants and animals.": "Beskikbare produkillustrasies, in een styl. Die plan sluit ook nagevorsde plante sonder 'n produkillustrasie in. Geskiktheid en produksie hang af van jou plaas se klimaat, plante en diere.",
